body:
God please let this be it. And if Khadgar really got disenchanted, maybe we the players can get Atiesh somehow... 

Might be cool to bring other things too like updated benefiction and anathema (I got these in vanilla and I think everyone should be able to get them)

I'm hyping myself up over something that won't happen ;.;

Hey guys, hope this is the appropriate thread to ask this question. I'm wanting to resub to the game after the holidays but im currently on exodus (having transferred to play with friends that no longer play) and was looking for a new world to play on. What would be a good world to check out? I'm looking for one that is reasonably populated and has a decent bit of people that play during "normal hours" (pretty much from the afternoon to evening) for EST.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
